{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mind Palace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660570/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-19_141213.png?t=1745099558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plug into the <i>Human Interface</i> and connect yourself to the dreamy world of Mind Palace. A place for movement, to explore\u00a0and to let your thoughts thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a surreal open world filled with winding paths and shifting biomes. Hike through colourful meadows, climb towering structures, jump across rocks, run through dark caves, slide down steep slopes, or zipline from peaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Curious things await in every corner - the world is yours to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Spatial Home for Your Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're given a full set of tools to express your thoughts: write with a keyboard, draw with the drawboard, or speak freely using your microphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your notes in meaningful locations, connect them to spark new ideas, and organize everything with topics. Use the topic gun to place key themes, move multiple notes using the inventory jar, and delete irrelevant ones with a satisfying smash from the hammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also import your own notes including text, images, audio and even PDF files. Additionally you can import notes\u00a0from the following apps:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Notion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obsidian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Google Keep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OneNote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evernote</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need inspiration? Receive endless, randomized quests to guide you \u2014 like connecting ideas, using a specific tool, or completing a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on fast-paced parkour runs scattered across the world. Run your way through timed challenges and beat your personal best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no single way to use your mind. Just enter, explore, and see what thoughts bubble up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack by Amrock Plaza</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2660570?t=1745099558","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745099558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745099558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745099558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mind Palace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660570/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-19_141213.png?t=1745099558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plug into the <i>Human Interface</i> and connect yourself to the dreamy world of Mind Palace. A place for movement, to explore\u00a0and to let your thoughts thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse a surreal open world filled with winding paths and shifting biomes. Hike through colourful meadows, climb towering structures, jump across rocks, run through dark caves, slide down steep slopes, or zipline from peaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Curious things await in every corner - the world is yours to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Spatial Home for Your Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're given a full set of tools to express your thoughts: write with a keyboard, draw with the drawboard, or speak freely using your microphone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place your notes in meaningful locations, connect them to spark new ideas, and organize everything with topics. Use the topic gun to place key themes, move multiple notes using the inventory jar, and delete irrelevant ones with a satisfying smash from the hammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also import your own notes including text, images, audio and even PDF files. Additionally you can import notes\u00a0from the following apps:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Notion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obsidian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Google Keep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OneNote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evernote</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need inspiration? Receive endless, randomized quests to guide you \u2014 like connecting ideas, using a specific tool, or completing a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on fast-paced parkour runs scattered across the world. Run your way through timed challenges and beat your personal best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no single way to use your mind. Just enter, explore, and see what thoughts bubble up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack by Amrock Plaza</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["fatderda"],"dlc":[2886260],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description